. Mouth; face, countenance.\nL68: \nL69: بودن būdan\nL70: \nL71: P بودن būdan, inf. & v.n. To be; being, existence (=būd, q.v.).\nL72: بدون bidūn\nL73: \nL74: A بدون bidūn, prep. Without, deprived of; with the exception of, besides.\nL75: \nL76: بدين badīṅ =ba+īṅ\nL77: \nL78: P بدين badīṅ (=ba+īṅ), adv. To, for, or in this.\nL79: \nL80: ;\nL81: \nL82: مزید\nL83: ###### مزید لغتیں\nL84: \nL85:   * Madda hi Pg. 415\nL86:   * Farhang-e-Asifia Vol 1 ur Pg. 377\nL87:   * Lughaat e Kishori ur Pg. 63\nL88: \nL89: ## آپ اسے بھی پسند کر سکتے ہیں\nL90: \nL91: ### ہماری پسند\nL92: \nL93: ####   Farhang-e-Asifia (Vol. 1) Matches in 2 pages\nL94: \nL95: cite52†Image L96: \nL97: ##\nL98: \nL99: + -\nL100: \nL101: ### Hindi Dictionary\nL102: \nL103: cite53†Image: Madda†www.rekhta.org L104: \nL105: #### Madda\nL106: \nL107: ###### by Madda\nL108: \nL109: ### Urdu Dictionary\nL110: \nL111: cite54†Image: Farhang-e-Asifia Vol 1†www.rekhta.org L112: \nL113: #### Farhang-e-Asifia Vol 1\nL114: \nL115: ###### by Farhang-e-Asifia Vol 1\nL116: \nL117: cite55†Image: Lughaat e Kishori†www.rekhta.org L118: #### Lughaat e Kishori\nL119: \nL120: ###### by Lughaat e Kishori\nL121: \nL122: ## مزید دریافت کیجیے\nL123: \nL124: cite10† †play.google.com L125: \nL126: cite11†  L127: \nL128: cite12† †www.rekhtadictionary.com L129: \nL130: ## join rekhta family!\nL131: \nL132: You have exhausted 5 free content pages per year. Register and enjoy UNLIMITED  access to the whole universe of Urdu Poetry, Rare Books, Language Learning, Sufi Mysticism, and more.\nL133: \nL134: LOG IN REGISTER\nL135: \nL136: cite13†  L137: \nL138: cite13†  L139: #### شاعری\nL140: \nL141:   * cite14†شاعر L142:   * cite15†شعر L143:   * cite16†لغت L144:   * cite17†ویڈیو L145:   * cite18†ای-کتاب L146:   * cite19†نثر L147:   * cite20†بلاگ†blog.rekhta.org L148:   * cite21†شاعری L149:   * cite22†کویز L150:   * cite23†قافیہ L151:   * cite24†تقطیع L152:   * cite25† ایکسپلورر 